			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790000401,
					"content": "找到啦！寶藏！寶藏！裡面會有什麼呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000402,
					"content": "咦？上面怎麼有鎖。還、還是密碼鎖…需要密碼才能打開嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000403,
						790000404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000403,
					"content": "這鎖應該能直接砸開…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790000405,
					"content": "等一下！直接砸的話，要是裡面的東西也被砸壞了怎麼辦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000406,
					"content": "我們還是想想開鎖的方法吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000410,
					"content": "但既然這個箱子裝著的東西是「傳家寶」，而且這箱子還是用「密碼」的形式鎖住的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000411,
					"content": "那就是說，鎖住這個箱子的人認為，自己所留下的「密碼」能很容易就被記住…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000412,
					"content": "看來我們唯一的希望，就只有那些保存著聲音的海螺了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000413,
					"content": "再好好聽一下那些海螺裡的聲音吧，希望那些聲音裡真的有「密碼」的線索…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000404,
					"content": "要想想開鎖的方法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790000407,
					"content": "不過，周圍也沒有石碑、壁畫、紙條、刻字和筆記本的樣子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790000408,
					"content": "而且也沒有學者、盜寶團或者冒險家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790000409,
					"content": "是呢，唔唔，真是前所未有的大考驗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790000410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
